211
00:06:50,710 --> 00:06:52,590
There's no such thing as 'discompiling'...

212
00:06:52,590 --> 00:06:53,990
you can still disassemble it.

213
00:06:53,990 --> 00:06:56,050
So this is

214
00:06:56,050 --> 00:06:58,290
